  },
  {
   "id": "b59f1b6ed85e",
   "unit_id": "b59f1b6ed85ea149a456af75354116982744c3b2ec2bc73ecb22b28cddfbb0d5",
   "revision_key": "8423275d3bac3088743b43ed28f655fc50602bdf8b2d99fcf8fc9e9c21fe22aa",
   "translation_file": "tome-ashes-urhrok.lua",
   "translation_line": 1800,
   "section": "tome-ashes-urhrok/overload/data/texts/intro-ashes-urhrok.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Welcome #LIGHT_GREEN#@name@#WHITE#.\nYou do not remember much of your life before you were on this burning continent, floating in the void between worlds.  You have been helping demons, happily participating in their experiments to shatter some sort of shield preventing them from taking their righteous revenge on Eyal.\n\nYou are being taken by your handler to the torture-pits to help them figure out how to cause the most pain to those on Eyal, when you hear a roaring above you; you look up and see a burning meteor, flying closer, and the demons' spells failing to divert its course!  It lands near you, knocking you off your feet with its shockwave and killing your handler instantly.\n\nAs you recover, and your platform of searing earth splits from the main continent, your old memories flood your mind and you come to your senses - the demons are out to destroy your home!\n\n#{bold}#You must escape!#{normal}#.\n",
   "target": "你好，#LIGHT_GREEN#@name@#WHITE#。\n对于来到这片漂浮在世界之间虚空中的燃烧大陆之前的生活，你已经记不太清了。你曾经帮助过恶魔，满心欢喜地参与他们的实验，以打破某种阻止恶魔向埃亚尔展开正义复仇的无形屏障。\n\n你被你的“主人”带到折磨场以帮助研究如何对埃亚尔的生灵造成更大的痛苦，突然一阵轰鸣从天上传来，你抬头，看见一颗燃烧着的陨石正在坠落。恶魔试图用法术改变其轨迹，但没有成功！它落在你附近，冲击波将你掀翻在地，你的“主人”当场毙命。\n\n当你逐渐恢复意识、脚下这块灼热土地构成的平台正从主大陆分裂时，旧日的记忆涌入脑海。你终于清醒过来——恶魔们要毁灭你的故乡！\n\n#{bold}#你必须逃离这里！#{normal}#\n",
   "source_file": "/workspace/tome4-dlcs/ashes-urhrok/tome-ashes-urhrok/overload/data/texts/intro-ashes-urhrok.lua (unpinned public DLC checkout)",
   "source_lines": [
    22
   ],
   "previously_reviewed": {
    "A": true,
    "B": true
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "79fbdf981442",
   "unit_id": "79fbdf9814422eb498c2f689608a713b7c7dcc74aa639256508596d3fe14134f",
   "revision_key": "0ccaf8f510a57055c15d3ef1a429691a7a8f6f26cd0b4b1ff51470f8bb409748",
   "translation_file": "tome-ashes-urhrok.lua",
   "translation_line": 1936,
   "section": "tome-ashes-urhrok/superload/mod/dialogs/Birther.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Thank you for purchasing #CRIMSON#Ashes of Urh'Rok#WHITE#, the first expansion pack of Tales of Maj'Eyal.\n\nTo begin your adventures as a fiery bringer of doom simply create a character with the class #LIGHT_GREEN#Doombringer#WHITE# (in the Defiler category) and a race of #LIGHT_BLUE#%s#WHITE#.\n\nHave fun crushing your foes!\n",
   "target": "感谢你购买#CRIMSON#乌鲁洛克之烬#WHITE#，《马基·埃亚尔的传说》的第一个扩展包。\n\n要以带来毁灭的烈焰使者身份开始冒险，只需创建一个角色：职业选择#LIGHT_GREEN#毁灭使者#WHITE#（堕落系），种族选择#LIGHT_BLUE#%s#WHITE#。\n\n尽情碾碎你的敌人吧！\n",
   "source_file": "/workspace/tome4-dlcs/ashes-urhrok/tome-ashes-urhrok/superload/mod/dialogs/Birther.lua (unpinned public DLC checkout)",
   "source_lines": [
