  {
   "id": "8bcfceb6d650",
   "unit_id": "8bcfceb6d65012400df32d86da3d7e23da651362ccf4ebc59bdf177fb399ad3c",
   "revision_key": "18c51b1eee3f63d17b10ae8004cd0dd21ec427cce540bc4097f4b303ccda6a20",
   "translation_file": "tome-cults.lua",
   "translation_line": 2944,
   "section": "tome-cults/data/talents/demented/horrific-body.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "When you make your pustules explode you leave a pool of defiled blood on the ground for 5 turns.\n\t\tFoes caught inside get assaulted by black tentacles every turn, dealing %d%% darkness tentacle damage and covering them in your black blood for 2 turns.\n\t\tCreatures that hit you while covered in your blood heal you for %d%% of the damage done.\n\t\tThe healing received increases with your Spellpower.",
   "target": "每次脓包爆裂时，你会在地上留下一滩持续 5 回合的污血。\n\t\t范围内的敌人每回合会遭到黑色触手攻击，受到 %d%% 暗影触手伤害并被污血覆盖 2 回合。\n\t\t被污血覆盖的生物击中你时，你回复相当于该伤害 %d%% 的生命值。\n\t\t回复量随法术强度提高。",
   "source_file": "/workspace/tome4-dlcs/cults/tome-cults/data/talents/demented/horrific-body.lua (unpinned public DLC checkout)",
   "source_lines": [
    155
   ],
   "previously_reviewed": {
    "A": true,
    "B": true
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "f9e9e4c6d70e",
   "unit_id": "f9e9e4c6d70eca7ae2f50db5de60e5bd7ac06aae1e76cdef68c967cbe95976a5",
   "revision_key": "4313528332105f9083d12f921d339c06369234915838f36027c294ff37a9b058",
   "translation_file": "tome-cults.lua",
   "translation_line": 3194,
   "section": "tome-cults/data/talents/demented/tentacles.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Your left hand mutates into a disgusting mass of tentacles.\n\t\tWhen you have your offhand empty you automatically hit your target and those on the side whenever you hit with a basic attack.\n\t\tAlso increases Physical Power by %d, and increases weapon damage by %d%% for your tentacles attacks.\n\t\tEach time you make an attack with your tentacle you gain %d insanity.\n\t\tYou generate a low power psionic field around you when around #{italic}#'civilized people'#{normal}# that prevents them from seeing you for the horror you are.\n\n\t\tYour tentacle hand currently has these stats%s:\n\t\t%s",
   "target": "你的左手异变成为一坨恶心的触手。\n\t\t副手空闲时，当使用普通攻击，触手会自动攻击目标，以及以你为中心、位于攻击方向左右相邻格的敌人。\n\t\t物理强度提高 %d， 触手武器伤害提高 %d%%。\n\t\t每次触手攻击时，获得 %d 疯狂值。\n\t\t附近有#{italic}#“文明人”#{normal}#时会自动生成微弱的灵能力场，避免被他们发现你的恐魔形态。\n\n\t\t你的触手当前属性%s：\n\t\t%s",
   "source_file": "/workspace/tome4-dlcs/cults/tome-cults/data/talents/demented/tentacles.lua (unpinned public DLC checkout)",
   "source_lines": [
    72
