   "section": "tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/other.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Activate the pistons to crush your target for %d turns and dealing %d%% unarmed melee damage.\n\t\tWhile the target is held it can not move and its armour and defense are reduced by %d.\n\t\t#{italic}#Crush their bones!#{normal}#",
   "target": "激活活塞碾压你的目标 %d 回合，并造成 %d%% 的徒手伤害。\n\t\t被碾压的目标会被定身，且其护甲和闪避减少 %d。\n\t\t#{italic}#压碎他们的骨头！#{normal}#",
   "source_file": "/workspace/tome4-dlcs/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/other.lua (unpinned public DLC checkout)",
