   "section": "tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/physics.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Allows you to create electrical tinkers of level %d.\n\t\tYou will learn a new schematic at level 1.\n\t\tEach other talent level, you have a 20%% chance to learn one more random schematic, if you have not gained it by level 5 you are guaranteed it (unless all are known).\n\t\t%s",
   "target": "允许你制造 %d 等级的电力配件。\n\t\t你将在 1 级时学会一个新配方。\n\t\t之后每提升一个技能等级，你有 20%% 的概率再学会一个随机配方；如果到 5 级仍未学会，则必定学会（除非已学会全部配方）。\n\t\t%s",
   "source_file": "/workspace/tome4-dlcs/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/physics.lua (unpinned public DLC checkout)",
